## SRX-1 — interfaces and zones (from the lab guide)
set interfaces ge-0/0/0 unit 0 family inet address 203.0.113.1/30
set interfaces ge-0/0/1 unit 0 family inet address 192.168.10.1/24
set interfaces st0 unit 0 family inet address 10.10.10.1/30
set security zones security-zone untrust interfaces ge-0/0/0.0
set security zones security-zone untrust interfaces st0.0
set security zones security-zone trust interfaces ge-0/0/1.0
set security zones security-zone trust host-inbound-traffic system-services all
set security zones security-zone trust host-inbound-traffic protocols all
set security zones security-zone untrust host-inbound-traffic system-services ike
